{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"DHI-3yvr-7pim-u5ee-ia46","published":"2026-11-11T15:41:32Z","modified":"2026-11-25T01:30:12.888254792Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-94265"],"summary":"When processing an HTTP redirect to a URL containing userinfo (a","details":"When processing an HTTP redirect to a URL containing userinfo (a\n`username:password` component), curl might erroneously retain and re-transmit\nthe original host's HTTP Negotiate authentication state. Consequently, a\nmalicious server can trigger a redirect containing arbitrary userinfo to force\ncurl to send a freshly minted Kerberos ticket—generated using the ambient\nidentity of the client process to an untrusted third-party host, effectively\nbypassing the domain-scoping restrictions normally enforced by the absence of\n`--location-trusted`.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"curl","ecosystem":"Docker Hardened Images:Alpine:3.23","purl":"pkg:apk/dhi/curl"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"8.17.0"}]}],"versions":["8.17.0","8.17.0-r1","8.18.0","8.18.0-r0","8.19.0-r0","8.20.0-r0","8.20.0-r1","8.21.0-r0","8.22.0-r0","8.23.0-r0","8.23.0-r1"],"database_specific":{"owner_kind":"HSP","source":"https://github.com/docker-hardened-images/advisories/blob/main/dhi/osv/2026/DHI-3yvr-7pim-u5ee-ia46.json"}},{"package":{"name":"curl","ecosystem":"Docker Hardened Images:Alpine:3.24","purl":"pkg:apk/dhi/curl"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"8.20.0-r1"}]}],"versions":["8.20.0-r1","8.21.0-r0","8.22.0-r0","8.22.0-r1","8.23.0-r0"],"database_specific":{"owner_kind":"HSP","source":"https://github.com/docker-hardened-images/advisories/blob/main/dhi/osv/2026/DHI-3yvr-7pim-u5ee-ia46.json"}}],"references":[{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://scout.docker.com/v/DHI-3yvr-7pim-u5ee-ia46"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-94265"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://security.alpinelinux.org/vuln/CVE-2026-94265"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://security-tracker.debian.or